# Environment variables / secrets — never commit these.
# This app doesn't currently use a .env file (the Supabase anon key is
# meant to be public and is hardcoded in js/supabase-config.js on purpose;
# the service-role key is only ever passed as an env var when running
# scripts/migrate-staff-to-auth.ts by hand, never stored in a file). This
# is a safety net for if that ever changes.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Editor cruft
*.swp
.vscode/
